    md 16/12, lg 20/14 pt (box/icon), corner ~4–5 (web `rounded`), scaled by @ScaledMetric.
  Visual state -> CheckboxVisualState.resolve reproduces peer-indeterminate > peer-checked
    precedence (mixed shows the Minus glyph even when checked); glyph checkmark/minus =
    lucide Check/Minus; token colors via CheckboxPalette (accent border + accent/20 fill +
    accent glyph when active; design border + surface fill when off) — adaptive across
    light/dark/high-contrast.
  Interaction -> CheckboxInteraction.nextValue gates on `isEnabled` (web `if (disabled)
